# Lockfiles (use bun)
package-lock.json

# apps/api uses npm (not bun) for its CI e2e workflow, so its lockfile
# is the source of truth for `npm ci` and must be committed. This is the
# only exception to the "use bun" rule above; new apps should default to
# bun and follow the same pattern if they need npm.
!apps/api/package-lock.json

